<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>2.  You can view orders in the database based on:</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<pardef id='5' leftmargin='1.5000in' rightmargin='73%' list='bullet'/>
<par def='5'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Date ordered</run></par>
<par def='5'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Status of the order</run></par>
<par def='5'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Who placed the order</run></par>
<par def='5'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Project the order was placed under</run></par>
<par def='5'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Supplier</run></par>
<par def='5'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Order Number</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>3.  Select the type of view you want by clicking on the choice on the Navigator.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>4.  Find the desired order in the view on the right and open it by double clicking on the order.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<pardef id='6' leftmargin='1.0021in' rightmargin='73%' firstlineleftmargin='0.8118in'/>
<par def='6'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>5.  Reconcile the financial information in the Order Tracking database against the credit card statement or invoice from the supplier/company.</run></par>
<par def='6'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>6.  Record the supplier/company invoice number in the Invoice Number Field.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>7.  To change the status to reconciled, click on the Reconciled button on the Action Bar.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
